{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122440","id":4286266587,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7_ezzb","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122440","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122440.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122440.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122440","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122440/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122440/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122440/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9c6365a7af14d68c91ef01265919aa494f18fc8d","number":122440,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"🤖 Import: Reject built-in resources in scene import options","user":{"login":"basteez","id":2451183,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTExODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2451183?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez","html_url":"https://github.com/basteez","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> [!NOTE]\r\n> **AI disclosure:** AI-assisted (Claude via Claude Code), human-directed and reviewed. The contributor picked the issue, chose the approach, and verified the change, working from a spec-driven (BMAD) process.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe \"Root Script\" import option (and other resource options) is edited with the generic resource picker, whose \"New Script...\" entry creates an in-memory built-in resource. Import options are stored in the text `.import` file and can only\r\nreference resources saved on disk, so the built-in one gets a synthetic `res://::<id>` path. The import dialog has no owner for it, leaving the owner part empty and producing an unusable path like `res://::GDScript_j3pel`, which then\r\nfails to load:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Resource file not found: res://::GDScript_j3pel (expected type: Script)\r\n```\r\n\r\nReject a built-in resource assigned to an import option, both in the Import dock and in the Advanced Import Settings dialog: the option is left unset and a warning explains that the resource must be saved to a file first. Picking an existing script file still works. The guard sits at the data layer, so it also covers per-node scripts and any other resource option.\r\n\r\nVerified so far: the editor builds and links cleanly with the change, and the Root Script option is present on a glTF scene import. ~The runtime before/after in the editor UI still needs a manual check, which is why this is a draft.~ Manual check done\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-15T12:50:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T09:11:22Z","closed_at":"2026-08-15T13:13:50Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"64e9d66c483e410168761f78181b38c1ff2ec504","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"basteez:fix-import-builtin-script-118407","ref":"fix-import-builtin-script-118407","repo":{"id":1333341679,"node_id":"R_kgDOT3kt7w","name":"godot","full_name":"basteez/godot","owner":{"login":"basteez","id":2451183,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTExODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2451183?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez","html_url":"https://github.com/basteez","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basteez/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Godot Engine – Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine","homepage":"https://godotengine.org","language":null,"visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":0,"open_issues":0,"size":1587572,"default_branch":"master","has_issues":false,"has_projects":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_downloads":false,"has_discussions":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pushed_at":"2026-08-15T12:57:05Z","created_at":"2026-08-13T16:53:10Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T16:53:10Z","allow_forking":true,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"pull_request_